<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - GFNorte started as hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GFNorte started as hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analysts Susana Ornelas and Enrique Pani on Thursday started coverage of Mexico's Grupo Financiero Banorte SA de CV, or GFNorte, with a rating of hold.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although the stock looks attractive on both a traditional and adjusted P/BV basis, there is an important degree of uncertainty associated with its expansion plans ...,&quot; they wrote in a report.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company were unchanged at 8.40 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
